       <narrative xml:lang="EN">A follow up PSD project on technical assistance to horticulture  producers to could be developed after completion of the actual assignment .  The aim of this new project is to develop the sector and create the necessary pre conditions in order to improve the ability to incorporate Dutch (mid tech) know how and technology . 
So after the project it is expected that the sector is more ready (number of pre-conditions fulfilled) to incorporate Dutch know how and technology and therefore market opportunities and market access will have improved. Follow up will be to attract Dutch companies to become active on the Colombian market.</narrative>
